<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<module fritzingVersion="1.0.0" moduleId="greenhouse-pro-wiring">
  <title>Greenhouse Pro Wiring</title>
  <author>Anicca</author>
  <description>
    Breadboard-level wiring summary for the Greenhouse Pro kit.
    This sketch mirrors kits/greenhouse-pro/WIRING.md and is intended as a starter source bundle
    for import into Fritzing before replacing generic headers with exact part footprints.
  </description>
  <notes>
    <![CDATA[
LicheeRV-Nano:
- I2C SDA -> pin 3
- I2C SCL -> pin 5
- DS18B20 bus -> pin 7 / GPIO4
- Rain digital -> pin 8 / GPIO14
- Rain analog -> pin 13 / GPIO27
- Soil moisture analog -> pin 37 / GPIO26
- Relay channels -> pins 11, 12, 35, 36

Shared power:
- 3.3V powers BME280 / SGP30 / BH1750 / DS18B20 / moisture / rain board
- External 12V powers relay coils and actuators

See WIRING.md for current budget, pull-ups, and actuator-side wiring.
    ]]>
  </notes>
</module>
